id: pm-a24aqt
title: "Dependabot alert #43: PostCSS previous source-map path traversal (GHSA-r28c-9q8g-f849)"
description: "Resolve GitHub Dependabot alert #43 for transitive development dependency postcss 8.5.16, vulnerable through 8.5.17 to arbitrary .map file disclosure when auto-loading previous source maps. Upgrade the lockfile graph to postcss 8.5.18 or newer through the owning Vite/Vitest dependency path, preserve release-age and supply-chain policy, and prove the alert closes without weakening any gate."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
